## Simulator

```sh
tapyr sim --provider-path <parent directory> --provider __NAME__ --listen 127.0.0.1:8081
```

The simulator serves `sim/fixtures/devices.json` under `/v1`: 2 devices.

| Scenario | Effect |
|---|---|
| `default` | No fault |
| `quota-tight` | The daily quota drops to 200 calls |
| `bad-day` | Another client consumes 10 calls per hour; from 2h to 2h20, 30% of `/devices` requests fail with 503 |

